Package: ColorLab
Title: Interactive Color and Shape Palette Designer for ggplot2
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Boaz", "Rosenberg", email = "BoazRsnbrg@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Provides a minimal interactive learnr tutorial designed specifically for the
    narrow dimensions of the RStudio Tutorial Pane. Users can interactively design
    custom color palettes, sample and edge-prune preset palettes, build multi-anchor
    asymmetric interpolated gradients, and configure ggplot2 shape scales with live
    color vision deficiency (CVD) simulation.
